# NovaFlow line-ending and diff policy (Phase 0)
#
# NOTE: text line-ending normalization (e.g. `* text=auto eol=lf`) is
# DEFERRED deliberately. core.autocrlf is set to false locally so Git stores
# bytes exactly as they appear on disk. Forcing LF now would rewrite
# analyzer_nova.py and prompts.py, which are two of the five files already
# present in the remote commit e059a9c and which Phase 0 must preserve
# byte-for-byte. Revisit as an explicit, reviewed change in a later phase.

# Treat binary assets as binary so Git never attempts normalization or diffs.
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.png   binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.mp4   binary
*.mov   binary
*.avi   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary

# Lockfiles: keep out of diff noise, still tracked.
package-lock.json -diff
